Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:06.83,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(796,830)}裤头村
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.87,0:01:15.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最有内涵的节目
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.87,0:01:15.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All of the most intelligent programming
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.83,0:01:17.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都是凌晨五点前开播的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.83,0:01:17.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,starts before 5:00 A.M.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.59,0:01:22.85,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(936,924)}我们的节目\N即将开播
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.85,0:01:23.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用急
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.85,0:01:23.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, no
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.87,0:01:24.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.87,0:01:24.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Take your time
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.95,0:01:26.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,值得一等
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.95,0:01:26.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's worth the wait
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.35,0:01:28.98,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(710,878)}裤头村公共电视台出品
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.94,0:01:32.07,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(876,412)}时尚华美秀
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.07,0:01:35.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,本节目可让您即时了解异国名宠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.07,0:01:35.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your source for the latest in exotic pets
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.86,0:01:35.28,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(560,324)}异国名宠
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.72,0:01:37.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嵌有珠宝的手套收藏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.72,0:01:37.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,collectible jewel-encrusted mittens
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.45,0:01:37.78,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(726,802)}嵌有珠宝的手套
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.74,0:01:42.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以及古典门铃之轻响
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.74,0:01:42.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And classical doorbell chimes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.74,0:01:42.12,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(710,822)}古典门铃
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.37,0:01:43.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多精致啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.37,0:01:43.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How sophisticated
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.25,0:01:46.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但现在停播了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.25,0:01:46.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Has been cancelled
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.25,0:01:46.96,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(454,818)}停播
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.33,0:01:50.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,啊对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.33,0:01:50.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.91,0:01:52.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还没煮咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.91,0:01:52.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I haven't made the coffee yet
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.65,0:01:55.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么可以停播时尚华美秀啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.65,0:01:55.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why in the world would they cancel fab and fancy?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.45,0:01:57.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么节目还能比它更有内涵
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.45,0:01:57.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What could possibly be more enriching?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.94,0:02:15.57,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(704,908)}吉他之神
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.19,0:02:20.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是吉他之神宙斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.19,0:02:20.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm Zeus, the guitar lord
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.34,0:02:23.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然我还没有吉他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.34,0:02:23.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't have a guitar yet
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.27,0:02:26.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但就算有  也得要个特带劲的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.27,0:02:26.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but if I did, I would want a really killer one
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.88,0:02:28.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,比如说这把
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:28.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,like this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.25,0:02:29.50,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1206,656)}超酷\N\N有弦\N\N战斧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.25,0:02:29.50,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(228,882)}响亮
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.63,0:02:33.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他很明显对音乐一窍不通
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.63,0:02:33.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He obviously doesn't know the first thing about music
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.71,0:02:35.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,气死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.71,0:02:35.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is an outrage
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.38,0:02:39.34,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(964,300)}马上拨打\N热线
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.38,0:02:39.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是我的电话号码  如果你想聊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.38,0:02:39.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So here's my number if you want to talk about--
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.94,0:02:41.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.94,0:02:41.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.77,0:02:43.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我时尚华美秀哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.77,0:02:43.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where is my fab and fancy?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.90,0:02:45.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.90,0:02:45.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your what?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.18,0:02:46.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我十分确定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.18,0:02:46.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm quite certain
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.77,0:02:49.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就算你懂吉他也不懂文化
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:49.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't know culture if it bit you on the guitar
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.67,0:02:52.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没吉他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:52.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't have a guitar
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.17,0:02:55.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,难道电视台随便给谁都开个节目吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.17,0:02:55.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do they give a show to just anybody over there?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.82,0:02:57.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,差不多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:02:57.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pretty much
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.00,0:02:59.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我妈把这档节目当生日礼物送我了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.00,0:02:59.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My mom gave me this one for my birthday
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.03,0:03:00.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:00.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.41,0:03:01.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.41,0:03:01.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.27,0:03:03.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我本来要吉他  或者以我命名的星星
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.27,0:03:03.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wanted a guitar or a star named after me
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.88,0:03:05.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过呢  也罢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.88,0:03:05.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but, you know, whatever
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.71,0:03:07.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,电视节目也还不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.71,0:03:07.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess a TV show is cool
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.50,0:03:08.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有这么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:08.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's that easy?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.72,0:03:13.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,喂  裤头村公共电视台吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.72,0:03:13.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello, Bikini Bottom public access?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.86,0:03:15.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我个电视节目
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.86,0:03:15.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Give me a TV show
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.11,0:03:15.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要节目
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.11,0:03:15.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I want a show
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.05,0:03:17.63,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(244,408)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.63,0:03:20.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再等一两分钟就好  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.63,0:03:20.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, just a few more minutes, Squiddie
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.38,0:03:19.76,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(794,862)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.80,0:03:24.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,照耀在聚光灯下的马上就是你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.80,0:03:24.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and it'll be your turn to bask in the limelight
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.91,0:03:28.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.91,0:03:28.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.05,0:03:31.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,照聚光灯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.05,0:03:31.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Limelight baskin'
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.01,0:03:32.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,照耀在聚光灯下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.01,0:03:32.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Baskin' in the limelight
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.55,0:03:36.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真尽兴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.55,0:03:36.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good times
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.03,0:03:38.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真尽兴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.03,0:03:38.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good times
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.47,0:03:42.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那你说的这聚光灯要上哪照啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.47,0:03:42.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So where will said basking take place?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.15,0:03:44.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,搞得好像我会告诉你似的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.15,0:03:44.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Like I would tell you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.14,0:03:47.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然我等了一辈子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.14,0:03:47.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Although I've waited my whole life
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.42,0:03:50.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,享尽荣耀  足以向别人炫耀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:50.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to have enough glory to rub it in someone's face
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.86,0:03:51.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,向任何人炫耀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.86,0:03:51.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,anyone's face
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.08,0:03:56.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,甚至向那家伙炫耀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:56.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Even that face
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.48,0:03:59.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是告诉你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.48,0:03:59.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll tell you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.17,0:04:01.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我最不想看到你跟过来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.17,0:04:01.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but the last thing I would want is for you to show up
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.67,0:04:03.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以给我堵住耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.67,0:04:03.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so plug your ears
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.47,0:04:07.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然我不想自吹自擂  但是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.47,0:04:07.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't want to toot my own whistle, but--
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.82,0:04:08.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等  不对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.82,0:04:08.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,wait, no
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.85,0:04:10.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还真想自吹自擂了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.85,0:04:10.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I mean to do
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.24,0:04:21.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再说一遍  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:21.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say again, Squidward
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.90,0:04:27.16,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(718,984)}裤头村公共电视台出品
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:32.04,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(348,684)}章鱼哥闲聊
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.80,0:04:32.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有请主持人  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.80,0:04:32.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With your host, Squidward tentacles
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.36,0:04:33.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.36,0:04:33.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Greetings
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.19,0:04:34.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.19,0:04:34.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm Squidward tentacles
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.92,0:04:37.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥闲聊的主持人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.92,0:04:37.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,your host of Squidward chat
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.23,0:04:42.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,本期章鱼哥闲聊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.23,0:04:42.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Today on Squidward chat
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.40,0:04:45.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要聊的是我最关心的内容
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.40,0:04:45.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we'll be discussing something near and dear to my heart
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.06,0:04:48.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,像我自己一样怀才不遇的艺术家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.06,0:04:48.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Underappreciated artists like myself
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.20,0:04:51.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥上电视了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.20,0:04:51.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward's on TV?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.27,0:04:55.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.27,0:04:55.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.49,0:04:56.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.49,0:04:56.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.12,0:05:05.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  你上电视了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.12,0:05:05.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, you're on TV
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.77,0:05:07.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  真的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.77,0:05:07.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, really
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.41,0:05:08.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  快来看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.41,0:05:08.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, come look
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.20,0:05:09.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道自己上电视了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:09.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know I'm on TV
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.37,0:05:10.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看见摄像机没
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.37,0:05:10.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See the camera?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.50,0:05:12.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你也上电视了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.50,0:05:12.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're on TV too
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.17,0:05:16.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,电视吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.17,0:05:16.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,TV?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.06,0:05:19.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.06,0:05:19.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Moron
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.22,0:05:23.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我刚刚说到  本期章鱼哥闲聊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.22,0:05:23.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As I was saying, today on Squidward chat
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.23,0:05:24.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要聊的是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.23,0:05:24.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we'll be discussing--
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.30,0:05:27.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我就跑去跟章鱼哥说他上电视了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.30,0:05:27.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So I ran to tell Squidward that he was on TV
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.93,0:05:29.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他就跟我说我上电视了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.93,0:05:29.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and he told me that I was on TV
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.73,0:05:30.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在你上电视了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.73,0:05:30.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now you're on TV
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.95,0:05:32.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我上电视了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.95,0:05:32.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm on TV?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.55,0:05:41.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不可能的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.55,0:05:41.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This isn't happening
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.19,0:05:43.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没上电视
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.19,0:05:43.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not on TV
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.90,0:05:48.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  我回家开了自家的电视
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:48.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, I went home and turned on my TV
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.97,0:05:51.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可电视上面没有我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.97,0:05:51.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I wasn't on the TV
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.40,0:05:53.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你为什么要骗我  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.40,0:05:53.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why did you lie to me, SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.65,0:05:54.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.65,0:05:54.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.85,0:05:57.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  你到底有多笨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.85,0:05:57.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, just how dumb are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.15,0:05:58.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看情况
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.15,0:05:58.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It varies
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.08,0:06:00.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是想上电视
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:06:00.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If you want to be on TV
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.13,0:06:02.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就得站在摄像机前面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.13,0:06:02.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you have to be in front of the camera
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.24,0:06:06.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.24,0:06:06.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I get it
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.15,0:06:10.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  看电视的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.15,0:06:10.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, TV people
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.63,0:06:15.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的嘴上电视了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:15.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My mouth is on TV
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.53,0:06:18.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恶心死了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.53,0:06:18.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is disgusting
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.50,0:06:25.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:25.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.22,0:06:26.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你得来试试看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:26.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got to try this
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.79,0:06:33.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.79,0:06:33.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.78,0:06:35.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别动我摄像机
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.78,0:06:35.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,get off my camera
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.17,0:06:41.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能不能给我滚出去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:41.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you get out of here?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.07,0:06:42.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,未必
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.07,0:06:42.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Doubt it
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.48,0:06:46.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是你这么喜欢摄像机
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.48,0:06:46.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If you like the camera so much
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.57,0:06:48.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干脆来做摄影师得了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.57,0:06:48.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,why don't you be the cameraman?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.90,0:06:50.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,摄影师吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:50.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cameraman?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.67,0:06:53.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,意思是你可以来拍美美的画面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.67,0:06:53.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That means you take all the pretty pictures
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.72,0:06:54.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.72,0:06:54.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.08,0:06:57.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也让我来做点事吧  拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.08,0:06:57.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let me do something too, please?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.66,0:06:59.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧  你来做录音师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.66,0:06:59.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine, you can be the sound man
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.23,0:07:01.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,录音师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.23,0:07:01.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sound man
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.92,0:07:02.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,俩蠢货
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.92,0:07:02.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Imbeciles
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.94,0:07:06.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,本期要聊的是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:06.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Today we're going to be talking about--
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.62,0:07:08.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,摄像机怎么没拍我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.62,0:07:08.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,why isn't the camera on me?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.86,0:07:11.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  讲话的是我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.86,0:07:11.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, I'm the one talking
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.90,0:07:15.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在这边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.90,0:07:15.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm right here
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.04,0:07:19.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,本期的章鱼哥闲聊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:19.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Today on Squidward chat
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.10,0:07:21.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要聊的是怀才不遇的艺术
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:21.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we'll be discussing the underappreciated arts
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.60,0:07:23.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  我在这下面
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:23.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, I'm down here
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.61,0:07:27.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我刚刚说到  本期要聊的是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.61,0:07:27.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As I was saying, today we'll be--
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.52,0:07:29.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,本期
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.52,0:07:29.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,today--
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.66,0:07:36.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上了个上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.66,0:07:36.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Upsy-Daisy
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.12,0:07:37.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下了个下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:37.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Downsy-wownsy
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.70,0:07:39.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上了个上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.70,0:07:39.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Upsy-Daisy
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.39,0:07:40.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下了个下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.39,0:07:40.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Downsy-wownsy
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.45,0:07:51.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.45,0:07:51.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, then
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.20,0:07:54.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我本来要跟大家聊我杰出的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.20,0:07:54.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was going to tell you about my fabulous--
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.83,0:08:00.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.83,0:08:00.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sponge--
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.73,0:08:04.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太重了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.73,0:08:04.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's heavy
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.23,0:08:08.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.23,0:08:08.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.09,0:08:09.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是好痒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.09,0:08:09.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but it itches
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.34,0:08:10.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得上厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:10.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got to go potty
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.66,0:08:12.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥还有自己的电视节目吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.66,0:08:12.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward has his own TV show?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.59,0:08:14.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只许憋着  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.59,0:08:14.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, you'll just have to hold it, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.90,0:08:18.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然现在没人打岔了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.90,0:08:18.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, if there are no more interruptions--
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.19,0:08:19.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来蟹堡王用餐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.19,0:08:19.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eat at the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.81,0:08:22.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正宗蟹黄堡之家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.81,0:08:22.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,home of the original Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.10,0:08:25.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别忘了  我们的油一个月一换
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.10,0:08:25.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and remember, we change our grease monthly
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.08,0:08:26.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,出去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:26.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Out
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.90,0:08:30.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.90,0:08:30.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.25,0:08:31.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.25,0:08:31.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.47,0:08:33.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不止要你们来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.47,0:08:33.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We don't just want you
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.38,0:08:35.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还要你们的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:35.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We want your money too
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.95,0:08:36.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:36.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Whee, doggy
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.82,0:08:38.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跳排舞可比那好太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.82,0:08:38.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can line dance better than that
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.10,0:08:45.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老爸  我借用下你钱包
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.10,0:08:45.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Daddy, I'm borrowing your wallet
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.08,0:08:47.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,排舞吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.08,0:08:47.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Line dancing?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.32,0:08:50.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,土死了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.32,0:08:50.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That is so lame
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.27,0:08:53.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们需要我的超酷啦啦舞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.27,0:08:53.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What they need is my way cool cheer routine
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.53,0:08:56.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我一个K
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.53,0:08:56.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Give me a "k"
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.50,0:09:00.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.50,0:09:00.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, please
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.02,0:09:03.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的附带伤害可比那严重多了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.02,0:09:03.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can cause far more collateral damage than that
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.20,0:09:05.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凯伦  你把我死亡射线放哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.20,0:09:05.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Karen, where'd you put my death ray?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.69,0:09:06.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冲啊小队
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.69,0:09:06.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go, team
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.91,0:09:07.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.91,0:09:07.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.85,0:09:08.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冲啊小队
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.85,0:09:08.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go, team
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.82,0:09:09.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.82,0:09:09.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.56,0:09:11.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冲啊小队
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.56,0:09:11.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go, team
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.45,0:09:12.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.45,0:09:12.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.40,0:09:16.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我短裤都湿了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.40,0:09:16.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My shorts are wet
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.07,0:09:17.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加油小队
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.07,0:09:17.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fight, team
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.98,0:09:18.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.98,0:09:18.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fight
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.77,0:09:19.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加油小队
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.77,0:09:19.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fight, team
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.62,0:09:20.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:20.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fight
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.45,0:09:21.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加油小队
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.45,0:09:21.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fight, team
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.57,0:09:22.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.57,0:09:22.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fight
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.91,0:09:25.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不来海之霸用餐就去死
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.91,0:09:25.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eat at the chum bucket or perish
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.50,0:09:29.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王啊蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.50,0:09:29.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krusty Krab, the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.70,0:09:31.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来蟹堡王用餐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.70,0:09:31.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eat at the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.50,0:09:32.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:32.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.85,0:09:34.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的节目
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.85,0:09:34.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My show
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.82,0:09:40.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感觉你很紧绷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.82,0:09:40.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You seem tense
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.95,0:09:42.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.95,0:09:42.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cut that out
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.33,0:09:43.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:43.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's it
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.85,0:09:46.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都给我出去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:46.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone out
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.52,0:09:48.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们把这当什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.52,0:09:48.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you think this is, huh
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.27,0:09:49.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,乔迁派对是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.27,0:09:49.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,some kind of housewarming?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.79,0:09:52.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有人提到乔迁派对了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.79,0:09:52.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did somebody say housewarming?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.03,0:09:54.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家快来  这边在开乔迁派对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.03,0:09:54.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone, it's a housewarming
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.52,0:10:06.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,滚出我的片场
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.52,0:10:06.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get off my set
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.51,0:10:08.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,根本不行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.51,0:10:08.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is not working
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.98,0:10:13.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实呢  我觉得这节目还行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.98,0:10:13.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'd say the show is doing just fine
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.09,0:10:18.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,至少最新的收视率数据是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.09,0:10:18.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,at least according to our latest ratings
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.13,0:10:26.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以公共电视的标准  这其实算多的了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.13,0:10:26.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is actually a lot by public access standards
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.39,0:10:30.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家继续拍  除了你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.39,0:10:30.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone is working out, except for you
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.43,0:10:32.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.43,0:10:32.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.72,0:10:33.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.72,0:10:33.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.09,0:10:34.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.09,0:10:34.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and you
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.10,0:10:35.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.10,0:10:35.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.59,0:10:41.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在是裤头村
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.59,0:10:41.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And now Bikini Bottom's
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.55,0:10:44.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,近二十周最火爆的公共电视节目
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.55,0:10:44.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,top public access show for the last 20 weeks
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.89,0:10:47.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥的家庭派对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.89,0:10:47.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward's house party
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.37,0:10:48.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有请主持人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.37,0:10:48.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with your host
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.03,0:10:52.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吉他之神宙斯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.03,0:10:52.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Zeus, the guitar lord
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.69,0:10:55.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裤头村
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.69,0:10:55.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.35,0:10:59.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好开个章鱼哥范儿的派对没
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.35,0:10:59.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to party Squidward style?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.51,0:11:00.97,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(408,250)}章鱼哥的摇滚
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.17,0:11:05.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你带我们收视率上第一
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.17,0:11:05.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you for making us number one
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.15,0:11:09.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为我终于能买一把新吉他了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.15,0:11:09.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,because I was finally able to get a new guitar
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.48,0:11:11.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.48,0:11:11.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.02,0:11:16.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来狂欢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.02,0:11:16.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's party
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.97,0:11:43.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小声点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.97,0:11:43.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Keep it down
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.32,0:11:45.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还要睡觉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:45.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.89,0:11:54.40,起司 特殊标题,,0,0,0,,我爱跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.69,0:11:56.90,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(237.33,454)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.69,0:11:56.90,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(475.661,716)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.69,0:11:59.32,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.98,0:11:59.32,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(393.575,408)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.98,0:11:59.32,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(513.742,662)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.44,0:12:01.95,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(431.6,534)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.44,0:12:01.95,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.74,0:12:07.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,附近貌似挺安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.74,0:12:07.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The coast looks clear
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.54,0:12:13.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.54,0:12:13.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.34,0:12:21.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天我想跳点舞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:21.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Today I feel like doing some dancing
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.79,0:12:23.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,笑死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.79,0:12:23.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's funny
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.81,0:12:26.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,傻子都知道跳舞得有音乐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.81,0:12:26.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Even a barnacle knows you need music to dance
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.70,0:12:29.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我有音乐啊  朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.70,0:12:29.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got music, friend
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.77,0:12:31.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就在我脑子里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.77,0:12:31.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in my mind
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.55,0:12:35.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我爱这首歌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.55,0:12:35.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love this song
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.17,0:12:39.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开跳了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.17,0:12:39.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here I go
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.98,0:12:46.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是我见过最傻的舞步了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.98,0:12:46.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That is the stupidest dance move I've ever seen
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.25,0:12:48.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁把你搁地球上的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.25,0:12:48.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who put you on the planet?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.73,0:13:49.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的蟹黄堡  女士
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.73,0:13:49.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your Krabby Patty, ma'am
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.55,0:13:50.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快吃吧  吞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.55,0:13:50.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now eat it, swallow it
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.97,0:13:52.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好去咀嚼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.97,0:13:52.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and chew it down
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.74,0:13:53.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多谢了  亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.74,0:13:53.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, darling
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.19,0:13:56.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的舞步也挺酷的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.19,0:13:56.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and your dance moves are pretty cool too
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.10,0:13:56.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.10,0:13:56.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.97,0:13:58.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你喜欢我的舞吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.97,0:13:58.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You like my dancing?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.14,0:13:58.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.14,0:13:58.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right, kid
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.96,0:14:00.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你让我眼花缭乱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:00.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got the dazzle, dazzle, dazzle
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.52,0:14:02.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我爱你那套先滑步后月面空翻
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:02.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love how you did that shuffle into the moonsault
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.63,0:14:03.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又稳稳落地的动作
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.63,0:14:03.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and then stuck the landing
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.06,0:14:05.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你能说这话可真好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.06,0:14:05.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that's very nice of you to say
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.94,0:14:06.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.94,0:14:06.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.89,0:14:09.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还没说完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.89,0:14:09.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not finished speaking words
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.07,0:14:10.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是个一流星探
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.07,0:14:10.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm a high-class talent agent
Dialogue: 1,0:14:10.55,0:14:12.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想请你来试镜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.55,0:14:12.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I want to invite you to an audition
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.25,0:14:14.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我这边有个有才的客户
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.25,0:14:14.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have a very talented client
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.13,0:14:15.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,需要一位伴舞
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.13,0:14:15.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,who needs a backup dancer
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.19,0:14:16.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而你正好满足要求
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.19,0:14:16.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and you got what it takes
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.97,0:14:19.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明天中午到我的舞室来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.97,0:14:19.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come down to my dance studio tomorrow at noon
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.16,0:14:21.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你前途无量  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.16,0:14:21.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're going places, kid
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.82,0:14:25.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你能不能别跳了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:25.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you please stop dancing?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.09,0:14:27.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的舞步还不能停  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.09,0:14:27.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, I can't stop dancing now, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.96,0:14:30.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明天就要试镜了  我得好好练
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:30.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have to practice for my big audition tomorrow
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.92,0:14:33.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你有舞蹈试镜会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.92,0:14:33.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got a dance audition?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.07,0:14:34.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  所以我得多练
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.07,0:14:34.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right, so I got to practice
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.65,0:14:36.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,赶在明天前能练多少练多少
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.65,0:14:36.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,as much as I can before tomorrow
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.25,0:14:37.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我有舞蹈试镜会
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.25,0:14:37.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Got a dance audition
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.15,0:14:40.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个傻子居然会有舞蹈试镜会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.15,0:14:40.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That idiot has a dance audition?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.05,0:14:43.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他对舞蹈错综复杂的小细节一窍不通
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.05,0:14:41.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know the first thing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.61,0:14:43.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,about the subtle intricacies of dance
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.70,0:14:46.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就让他练到累垮得了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.70,0:14:46.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let him practice till he drops
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.74,0:14:48.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,反正他也通不过试镜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.74,0:14:48.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's never gonna get that part
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.87,0:14:50.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.87,0:14:50.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's it
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.67,0:14:53.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就让他一直练  练到累垮他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.67,0:14:53.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He'll just have to practice till he drops
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.99,0:14:56.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等他垮了  我就过去顶他位置
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.99,0:14:56.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,When he does, I'll be there
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.11,0:14:59.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,穿好紧身连衣裤  展示我的舞步
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.11,0:14:59.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,all leotarded up and ready to show my stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.85,0:15:00.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.85,0:15:00.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.97,0:15:01.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  等下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.97,0:15:01.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, wait
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.75,0:15:07.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝啊  我应该可以指导指导你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.75,0:15:05.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, I mean, I suppose I
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:07.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,could take you under my tutelage
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.17,0:15:09.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给你教教几个舞步
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.17,0:15:09.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you know, show you a few moves
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.38,0:15:11.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让你指导我  真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.38,0:15:11.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Under your tutelage, really?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.15,0:15:11.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你认真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.15,0:15:11.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.84,0:15:15.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但你必须完全照我说的做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.84,0:15:15.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But you must do exactly what I say
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.08,0:15:15.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,懂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.08,0:15:15.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.40,0:15:17.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的舞步任你指挥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.40,0:15:17.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am dance putty in your hands
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.92,0:15:25.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在干什么  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:25.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.28,0:15:27.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,评定你的体质
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.28,0:15:27.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just a physical assessment
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.87,0:15:29.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都会给新生评定一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.87,0:15:29.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I do with all my new pupils
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.00,0:15:32.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我看呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.00,0:15:32.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd say
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.08,0:15:35.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,根据这些松弛脚踝的情况判断
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.08,0:15:35.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,judging from the condition of those flabby ankles
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.22,0:15:35.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,松弛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.22,0:15:35.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Flabby?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.82,0:15:36.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.82,0:15:36.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.55,0:15:38.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得让你先进行体能训练
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.55,0:15:38.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll need some physical conditioning
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.72,0:15:41.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才能让你踏上舞池
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.72,0:15:41.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,before you ever set foot on a dance parquet
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.60,0:15:45.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要你登顶牡蛎峰  然后再回来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.60,0:15:45.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I want you to run to the top of oyster peak and back
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.70,0:15:47.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能让我脚踝不再松弛都行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.70,0:15:47.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anything to get rid of these flabby ankles of mine
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.88,0:15:49.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等那白痴回来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.88,0:15:49.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,By the time that idiot gets back
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.90,0:15:51.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多半他就跳不动舞了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.90,0:15:51.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,he'll be too tired to dance
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.37,0:15:52.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.37,0:15:52.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What--
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.77,0:15:53.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.77,0:15:53.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what--
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.06,0:15:53.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在这干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.06,0:15:53.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.69,0:15:55.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我爬完牡蛎峰回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.69,0:15:55.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm back from mount oyster
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.00,0:15:56.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给  这是我在礼品店给你买的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.00,0:15:56.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here, got this for you at the gift shop
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.30,0:15:56.85,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(554,798)}牡蛎峰
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.31,0:15:58.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.31,0:15:58.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.70,0:16:01.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来上你第一节舞蹈课
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.70,0:16:01.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's move on to our first dance lesson
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.34,0:16:04.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你得在这跑步机上走太空步
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.34,0:16:04.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I want you to moonwalk on this treadmill
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.31,0:16:07.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要把这小说看完
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.31,0:16:07.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,while I read this entire novel
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.69,0:16:11.32,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(408,700)}贝壳之书
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.75,0:16:13.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他这是还在走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.75,0:16:13.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What, is he still at it?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.02,0:16:19.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的跑步机
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.02,0:16:19.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My treadmill
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.26,0:16:21.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  虽然健身很好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.26,0:16:21.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, Squidward, exercising's fun and all
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.56,0:16:23.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我什么时候才能学跳舞呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.56,0:16:23.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but when am I gonna learn some dancing?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.45,0:16:26.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是想学跳舞吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.45,0:16:26.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, you want to learn some dancing?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.45,0:16:28.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就教你跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.45,0:16:28.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll show you dancing
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.45,0:16:31.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知道什么东西最激动人心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.45,0:16:31.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know what gets people going?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.30,0:16:32.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,丝带
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.30,0:16:32.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ribbons
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.12,0:16:40.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在学着我跳
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.12,0:16:40.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, do just as I did
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.10,0:16:43.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.10,0:16:43.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.07,0:17:12.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那样吗  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:12.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Like that, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.15,0:17:15.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  试试这个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.15,0:17:15.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, try this
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.76,0:17:19.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,非常简单  还非常精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.76,0:17:19.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's simple and a real showstopper
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.60,0:17:21.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,注意看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.60,0:17:21.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pay close attention
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.52,0:17:32.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,换你来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.52,0:17:32.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now you
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.67,0:17:33.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.67,0:17:33.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gee, I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.83,0:17:34.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你确定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.83,0:17:34.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.80,0:17:36.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你想完美通过试镜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.80,0:17:36.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You want to ace the audition, don't you?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.95,0:17:37.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是很想  但
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.95,0:17:37.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, yes, but--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.57,0:17:39.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就跳
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.57,0:17:39.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then do it
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.75,0:18:51.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.75,0:18:51.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Enough
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.29,0:18:52.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听好  你这傻子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.29,0:18:52.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen, you pea brain
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.53,0:18:54.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这舞要一直练下去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.53,0:18:54.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we are gonna keep working on your routine
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.57,0:18:55.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,练不好不准停
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.57,0:18:55.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,until you get it right
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.36,0:18:59.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,练多久不关我的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.36,0:18:59.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I don't care how long it takes
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.10,0:19:01.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,仔细看好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.10,0:19:01.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, watch closely
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.87,0:19:04.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,啊一
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.87,0:19:04.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And a-one
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.77,0:19:06.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,啊二
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.77,0:19:06.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and a-two
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.31,0:19:07.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.31,0:19:07.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.17,0:19:10.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你觉得自己能行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.17,0:19:10.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You think you can handle that?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.21,0:19:10.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.21,0:19:10.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.83,0:19:12.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就去练
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.83,0:19:12.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then go and practice it
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.75,0:19:16.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跳得跟我不一样就不准停
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.75,0:19:16.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and don't stop until you've done exactly as I did
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.02,0:19:18.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,啊一  啊二
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.02,0:19:18.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And a-one and a-two
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.60,0:19:19.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.60,0:19:19.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and a--
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.90,0:19:20.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.90,0:19:20.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.26,0:19:22.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,啊一  啊二
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.26,0:19:22.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And a-one and a-two
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.84,0:19:23.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.84,0:19:23.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and a--
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.77,0:19:24.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.77,0:19:24.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.87,0:19:27.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别忘了  没跳好不准停
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.87,0:19:27.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember, don't stop till you've done it right
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.42,0:19:29.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.42,0:19:29.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.55,0:19:30.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,啊一
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.55,0:19:30.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And a-one
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.87,0:19:31.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,啊二
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.87,0:19:31.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and a-two
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.88,0:19:32.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.88,0:19:32.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and a-
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.31,0:19:33.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.31,0:19:33.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.36,0:19:41.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好去检查下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.36,0:19:41.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Better go check
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.16,0:19:43.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个黄色小调皮鬼进度怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.16,0:19:43.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,on the little yellow sea monkey's progress
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.69,0:19:48.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  舞步学会了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.69,0:19:48.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, SpongeBob, have you learned the moves?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.04,0:19:50.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,啊一  啊二
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.04,0:19:50.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And a-one and a-two
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.29,0:19:50.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.29,0:19:50.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and a--
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.55,0:19:53.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.55,0:19:53.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, now
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.07,0:19:54.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我教你这么多  你却这副德性
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.07,0:19:54.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,After all I've done for you?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:54.72,0:19:57.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只剩一天了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.72,0:19:57.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We've got one day, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.91,0:19:58.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.91,0:19:58.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.59,0:19:59.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快跳
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.59,0:19:59.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.25,0:19:59.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快跳
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.25,0:19:59.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.75,0:20:00.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,时间不等人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.75,0:20:00.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're burning daylight
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.81,0:20:14.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,啊一
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.81,0:20:14.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And a-one
Dialogue: 1,0:20:14.27,0:20:15.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,啊二
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.27,0:20:15.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and a-two
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.44,0:20:16.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.44,0:20:16.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and a--
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.75,0:20:18.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那样行吗  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.75,0:20:18.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is that okay, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.98,0:20:20.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,舞步没说服到我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.98,0:20:20.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm still not convinced
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.65,0:20:21.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再跳一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.65,0:20:21.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do it again
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.50,0:20:24.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,啊一
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.50,0:20:24.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And a-one
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.82,0:20:26.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,啊二
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:26.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and a-two
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.74,0:20:29.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,啊一啊二  再
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.74,0:20:29.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And a-one and a-two and-a
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.42,0:20:35.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.42,0:20:35.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And-a
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.02,0:20:38.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚安  可爱的王子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.02,0:20:38.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good night, sweet prince
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.15,0:20:41.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  我这位大明星
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.15,0:20:41.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and hello, stardom for yours truly
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.55,0:20:45.39,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(656,404)}今日试镜
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.39,0:20:47.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们小  又可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.39,0:20:47.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're tiny, we're cuddly
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.18,0:20:49.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快活热情引人抱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.18,0:20:49.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're bubbly, wubbly, huggly
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.56,0:20:51.52,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1140,870)}试镜
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.56,0:20:51.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是非常可爱  小朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.56,0:20:51.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was very cute, girls
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.41,0:20:53.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说实话  太过可爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.41,0:20:53.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's too cute
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.98,0:20:54.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,淘汰你们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.98,0:20:54.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're out
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.02,0:20:58.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早跟你说那是个馊主意了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.02,0:20:58.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I told you it was a stupid idea
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.48,0:20:59.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也讨厌你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.48,0:20:59.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I hate you too
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.82,0:21:01.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看下一位是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.82,0:21:01.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's see who's next
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.05,0:21:04.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.05,0:21:04.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob SquarePants
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.06,0:21:06.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.06,0:21:06.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob SquarePants
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.94,0:21:07.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.94,0:21:07.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.54,0:21:10.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该是没来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.54,0:21:10.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess he's not here
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.57,0:21:11.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.57,0:21:11.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's too bad
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.15,0:21:12.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他还不错的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.15,0:21:12.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He was good
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.05,0:21:15.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是谁能替代如此高水准的舞者呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.05,0:21:15.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But who could replace a dancer of such high caliber?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.62,0:21:18.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,唯有裤头村最佳的舞者
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.62,0:21:18.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Only the best dancer in Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.54,0:21:19.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.54,0:21:19.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.70,0:21:21.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我倒要评判一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.70,0:21:21.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be the judge of that
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.97,0:21:27.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请看大师的真功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.97,0:21:27.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Observe a true master at work
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.17,0:21:41.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.17,0:21:41.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sweet sassafras
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.97,0:21:44.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我看错了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.97,0:21:44.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do mine eyes deceive me?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.19,0:21:48.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那可是有史以来最最棒的舞步了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.19,0:21:45.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was the greatest routine
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.86,0:21:46.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,since the greatest thing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.99,0:21:48.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,since sliced bread dancing routine
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.99,0:21:50.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恭喜你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.99,0:21:50.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Congratulations
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.50,0:21:51.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你试镜通过
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.50,0:21:51.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got the gig
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.87,0:21:54.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,宝贝  我就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.87,0:21:54.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, baby, I knew it
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.22,0:21:56.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你绝对不会后悔做出这个决定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.22,0:21:56.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You won't be sorry you made this decision
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.40,0:21:58.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你应该也不会后悔的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.40,0:21:58.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't think you'll be sorry either
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.12,0:22:01.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为你得在章鱼威廉的表演上跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.12,0:22:01.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,because you'll be dancing in squilliam's show
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.35,0:22:04.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.35,0:22:04.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squ--
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.64,0:22:06.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别光站那啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.64,0:22:06.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, don't just stand there
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.39,0:22:07.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,动作快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.39,0:22:07.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get the sand out of your leotard
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.91,0:22:09.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我跳舞  白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.91,0:22:09.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and dance for me, nitwit
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.22,0:22:15.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跳
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.22,0:22:15.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dance
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.10,0:22:21.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是这么跳  榆木脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.10,0:22:21.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not like that, kelp for brains
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.91,0:22:23.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你管那叫跳舞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.91,0:22:23.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You call that dancing?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.69,0:22:25.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要这么跳
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.69,0:22:25.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do it like this
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.33,0:22:27.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跳了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.33,0:22:27.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here I go
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.66,0:22:35.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁把你搁地球上的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.66,0:22:35.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who put you on the planet?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.58,0:22:38.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得跳得跟我一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.58,0:22:38.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, do it exactly as I did
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.60,0:22:40.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没跳好不准停
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.60,0:22:40.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and don't stop till you get it right
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.95,0:22:43.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,练多久不关我的事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.95,0:22:43.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I don't care how long it takes
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.87,0:22:50.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我本来还报名试镜了的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.87,0:22:50.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was up for that part
